    RefIds:
    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: df2a458475fa4dd0b44d890938965e03
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A hit-and-run fighter (skirmisher, harrier, gnat drone — any faction): keeps just outside its target''s reach. When the target comes at it, it backs off (to cover if it can); when the target stops or turns away, it hits — a shot if it fights at range, a dart in and a strike if not; between, ranged ones hold their range and fire. The counter to chargers, packs and rushing players.'
        _children:
        - 741b687f49a545a1ad80b0f36b3fbbf5
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
